    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_11_text].content": {
      "pl": "Kierowniku… jesteś zajęty? N-nic wielkiego, tylko… Enkefalina zaraz zacznie się przelewać…",
      "kr_sha256": "9c9262f3e98819deb88c65b1c3d89f14036d301cae58957c5335f51501bced57",
      "en_sha256": "cb2597e856a36e42b81a492cc5fb392018da284ec9a64bf41df1f256987ed285",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_11_title].content": {
      "pl": "Enkefalina Naładowana",
      "kr_sha256": "7df31fcdbbb4314434c62ba08b2345e1b9d1aefc53bf9c1d944345a5867f001d",
      "en_sha256": "02844d4e0a143b55645bf196013066df647d1a32410dacf36d6946b1c5de27aa",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_12_text].content": {
      "pl": "Melduję, Kierowniku Wykonawczy. Enkefalina osiągnęła pełny stan. Zalecam jej zużycie bądź konwersję.",
      "kr_sha256": "9227564d184fb0f48921efa14b6f9cfeef73a2419dd2b4ee818eb7d42556aec1",
      "en_sha256": "7b828095fa67631bfbb0c663b3c24f0be6c207cd35fef44d119673a2b183a6ea",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_12_title].content": {
      "pl": "Enkefalina Naładowana",
      "kr_sha256": "7df31fcdbbb4314434c62ba08b2345e1b9d1aefc53bf9c1d944345a5867f001d",
      "en_sha256": "02844d4e0a143b55645bf196013066df647d1a32410dacf36d6946b1c5de27aa",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_13_text].content": {
      "pl": "Eee, Kierowniku! Słuchaj no, bak w autobusie pełny… Może byś tak zerknął?",
      "kr_sha256": "6d49d24be3f5df6ce67e09f6c50b5f54c57b843ad1d28682f7544ca628747a1c",
      "en_sha256": "3056d4e31f8af908b4ce6637e34c4dfe9b8efb4f346d7e34866d283909f55d34",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_13_title].content": {
      "pl": "Enkefalina Naładowana",
      "kr_sha256": "7df31fcdbbb4314434c62ba08b2345e1b9d1aefc53bf9c1d944345a5867f001d",
      "en_sha256": "02844d4e0a143b55645bf196013066df647d1a32410dacf36d6946b1c5de27aa",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_14_text].content": {
      "pl": "Koniec przerwy, Kierowniku Dante. Nie trzymaj autobusu na postoju zbyt długo.",
      "kr_sha256": "6d19a326c9d54b1ee6f2a91ea4f38bea9bb6797032159c84402cffe33d60b29e",
      "en_sha256": "af27b6ef454815a5f894c55dc272a082c4a203afca38e362ab635e84f12b567a",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_14_title].content": {
      "pl": "Enkefalina Naładowana",
      "kr_sha256": "7df31fcdbbb4314434c62ba08b2345e1b9d1aefc53bf9c1d944345a5867f001d",
      "en_sha256": "02844d4e0a143b55645bf196013066df647d1a32410dacf36d6946b1c5de27aa",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_15_text].content": {
      "pl": "Mefi ma pełny brzuszek. Charon mówi, że pora na brum-brum.",
      "kr_sha256": "091aefa3b6e875b1bcdb893a3609d3238e34f5d6ac6902171038c5786a730958",
      "en_sha256": "c663dbddb6b73a13b693615d9b3b9031c467a357e9376d1a0aa1ed0ac858e60c",
      "origin": "ai"
    },
    "dataList[id=push_notification_message_full_stamina_15_title].content": {
